SCOPE — PLEASE READ

The MIT licence above covers the SOURCE CODE of this project only: everything
under `app/src/`, the build tooling in `tools/`, and the documentation.

It does NOT cover the bundled media assets, which are third-party and are
included only so the studio runs as-is. No licence is granted for them here and
they remain under whatever terms they arrived with:

  - iphone-18-pro.usdz                 third-party device model
  - app/public/models/*.glb            generated from that model
  - app/public/textures/*              generated from that model; the four
                                       wallpapers are Apple artwork
  - screen/stock-wallpaper.jpg         Apple artwork
  - Gradient BG 1 - Balanced Desktop.json   supplied background animation

If you are reusing this project, supply your own model and background and
rebuild the derived assets with ./tools/build.sh.
